flowchart TD
  A([Staff member on ticket list or detail page]) --> B[Click Delete on a ticket]
  B --> C[Confirmation dialog: Delete this ticket?]
  C --> D{Confirm?}
  D -- Cancel --> E[Dialog closes, ticket unchanged]
  E --> F([End])
  D -- Delete --> G[Remove ticket from Supabase]
  G --> H{Deleted OK?}
  H -- No --> I[Error toast shown, ticket still listed]
  I --> F
  H -- Yes --> J[Success toast shown]
  J --> K[Ticket list refreshes without the ticket]
  K --> F
